src(12,'Rajya Sabha unstarred question 1856: Public hearing on Bt brinjal','Environment Ministry / Rajya Sabha','https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/219/Au1856.pdf?source=pqars','2010-03-15','Official record','Answer (a)–(b)','Ramesh records seven public-consultation locations and the 9 February 2010 moratorium on commercialisation pending resolution of concerns.','Government’s stated rationale; not independent determination of biological safety.')
