src(14,'Orissa Mining Corporation v. Ministry of Environment and Forest','Supreme Court of India; reproduction hosted by mines, minerals & PEOPLE','https://mmpindia.in/documents/resources/judgement/Niyamgiri-Judgment.pdf','2013-04-18','Court or commission','Paragraphs 1, 15, 55–63','Recounts denial of Stage-II forest clearance on 24 August 2010. Directs Gram Sabhas to determine community and religious rights, with a later MoEF clearance decision informed by those determinations.','Court document on an advocacy host. Do not relabel the 2013 directions as a decision personally issued by Ramesh or a simple blanket judicial endorsement of every 2010 finding.','Supreme Court | W.P.(C)180/2011')
