src(22,'Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013','India Code / Legislative Department','https://www.indiacode.nic.in/bitstream/123456789/2121/1/A2013-30.pdf','2013-09-26','Statute','Sections 2, 4–9, 26–30, 41; schedules','Enacted framework couples compensation and rehabilitation with social-impact procedures; section 2 differentiates private and qualifying PPP consent, with defined affected-family categories.','Consolidated text includes state amendments. This profile describes central 2013 design, not uniform current law in every state or legal advice.')
