src(47,'CWC press briefing by Venugopal and Ramesh','Indian National Congress','https://inc.in/media/press-releases/cwc-press-briefing-shri-k-c-venugopal-shri-jairam-ramesh-addressed-the-media','2026-09-29','Party or campaign','Dated heading','Dated party release identifies Ramesh as general secretary for communications at a CWC briefing.','Header inspected; embedded video not transcribed and no substantive statements inferred.')
